html</a>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1565" data-end=3D"1662" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1567" data-end=3D"1662" class=3D"">T=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargez l=
a version qui correspond =C3=A0 votre syst=C3=A8me d'exploitation (Windows,=
 macOS ou Linux).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1664" data-end=3D"1902" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1667" data-end=3D"1686" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
667" data-end=3D"1686">Installer XAMPP</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1690" data-end=3D"1902">
<li data-start=3D"1690" data-end=3D"1773" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1692" data-end=3D"1773" class=3D"">Lancez le fichier d'ins=
tallation t=C3=A9l=C3=A9charg=C3=A9 et suivez les instructions =C3=A0 l'=C3=
=A9cran.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1777" data-end=3D"1898" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1779" data-end=3D"1898" class=3D"">Lors de l'installation,=
 vous pouvez choisir de cocher les modules Apache et MySQL (et PHP si ce n=
=E2=80=99est pas d=C3=A9j=C3=A0 activ=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1903" data-end=3D"2111" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1906" data-end=3D"1924" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
906" data-end=3D"1924">D=C3=A9marrer XAMPP</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1928" data-end=3D"2111">
<li data-start=3D"1928" data-end=3D"1988" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1930" data-end=3D"1988" class=3D"">Une fois install=C3=A9,=
 ouvrez le panneau de contr=C3=B4le de XAMPP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1992" data-end=3D"2111" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1994" data-end=3D"2111" class=3D"">D=C3=A9marrez les servi=
ces <strong data-start=3D"2016" data-end=3D"2026">Apache</strong> et <stron=
g data-start=3D"2030" data-end=3D"2039">MySQL</strong> en cliquant sur les =
boutons correspondants dans le panneau de contr=C3=B4le.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"2113" data-end=3D"2165" class=3D"">1.3 <strong data-start=
=3D"2122" data-end=3D"2165">Configurer un projet Laravel avec XAMPP</strong=
></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"2167" data-end=3D"3235">
<li data-start=3D"2167" data-end=3D"2428" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2170" data-end=3D"2428" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
170" data-end=3D"2207">T=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargez et installez Composer</strong>
Laravel repose sur Composer pour la gestion des d=C3=A9pendances. Si Compos=
er n'est pas encore install=C3=A9, t=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargez-le depuis <a data-=
start=3D"2333" data-end=3D"2385" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"=
" href=3D"https://getcomposer.org/">https://getcomposer.org/</a> et suivez =
les instructions d'installation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2433" data-end=3D"2836" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2436" data-end=3D"2471" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
436" data-end=3D"2471">Cr=C3=A9er un nouveau projet Laravel</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2475" data-end=3D"2836">
<li data-start=3D"2475" data-end=3D"2580" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2477" data-end=3D"2580" class=3D"">Ouvrez une fen=C3=AAtre=
 de terminal ou d'invite de commande et naviguez jusqu'au r=C3=A9pertoire d=
e votre projet.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2584" data-end=3D"2728" class=3D"">
