<h3 data-start=3D"1300" data-end=3D"1364" class=3D"">Partie 2 : <strong dat=
a-start=3D"1315" data-end=3D"1364">D=C3=A9tail des r=C3=A9pertoires et fich=
iers principaux</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"1366" data-end=3D"1396" class=3D"">2.1 <strong data-start=
=3D"1375" data-end=3D"1396">Le dossier <code data-start=3D"1388" data-end=
=3D"1394">app/</code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"1397" data-end=3D"1601" class=3D"">Le dossier <code data-s=
tart=3D"1408" data-end=3D"1414">app/</code> contient le c=C5=93ur de votre =
application, o=C3=B9 se trouvent les classes principales comme les contr=C3=
=B4leurs, les mod=C3=A8les, les politiques, et d'autres classes essentielle=
s pour la logique m=C3=A9tier.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1603" data-end=3D"2807">
<li data-start=3D"1603" data-end=3D"1708" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1605" data-end=3D"1708" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
605" data-end=3D"1623"><code data-start=3D"1607" data-end=3D"1621">app/Cons=
ole/</code></strong> : Ce r=C3=A9pertoire contient toutes les commandes art=
isan personnalis=C3=A9es que vous cr=C3=A9ez.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1709" data-end=3D"1848" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1711" data-end=3D"1848" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
711" data-end=3D"1732"><code data-start=3D"1713" data-end=3D"1730">app/Exce=
ptions/</code></strong> : Ce dossier contient les classes qui g=C3=A8rent l=
es exceptions, y compris la gestion des erreurs de votre application.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1849" data-end=3D"2486" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1851" data-end=3D"1995" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
851" data-end=3D"1866"><code data-start=3D"1853" data-end=3D"1864">app/Http=
/</code></strong> : C'est l'un des r=C3=A9pertoires les plus importants dan=
s Laravel. Il contient les contr=C3=B4leurs, les middleware et les requ=C3=
=AAtes HTTP.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1998" data-end=3D"2486">
<li data-start=3D"1998" data-end=3D"2167" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2000" data-end=3D"2167" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
000" data-end=3D"2018"><code data-start=3D"2002" data-end=3D"2016">Controll=
ers/</code></strong> : Les contr=C3=B4leurs contiennent la logique de trait=
ement des requ=C3=AAtes HTTP. Par exemple, <code data-start=3D"2106" data-e=
nd=3D"2126">UserController.php</code> g=C3=A8re les actions li=C3=A9es aux =
utilisateurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2170" data-end=3D"2385" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2172" data-end=3D"2385" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
172" data-end=3D"2189"><code data-start=3D"2174" data-end=3D"2187">Middlewa=
re/</code></strong> : Les middlewares sont utilis=C3=A9s pour filtrer les r=
equ=C3=AAtes HTTP avant qu'elles n'atteignent le contr=C3=B4leur. Un exempl=
e typique est <code data-start=3D"2319" data-end=3D"2337">Authenticate.php<=
/code>, qui v=C3=A9rifie si un utilisateur est authentifi=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2388" data-end=3D"2486" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2390" data-end=3D"2486" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
390" data-end=3D"2405"><code data-start=3D"2392" data-end=3D"2403">Requests=
/</code></strong> : Ce r=C3=A9pertoire contient les classes de validation d=
e formulaire personnalis=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2487" data-end=3D"2640" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2489" data-end=3D"2640" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
489" data-end=3D"2506"><code data-start=3D"2491" data-end=3D"2504">app/Mode=
ls/</code></strong> : Ce dossier contient vos mod=C3=A8les Eloquent, qui re=
pr=C3=A9sentent les entit=C3=A9s de la base de donn=C3=A9es (par exemple, <=
code data-start=3D"2616" data-end=3D"2626">User.php</code>, <code data-star=
t=3D"2628" data-end=3D"2638">Post.php</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2641" data-end=3D"2807" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2643" data-end=3D"2807" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
643" data-end=3D"2663"><code data-start=3D"2645" data-end=3D"2661">app/Prov=
iders/</code></strong> : Ce r=C3=A9pertoire contient les services de votre =
application (par exemple, la liaison des services avec le conteneur d=E2=80=
=99injection de d=C3=A9pendances).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"2809" data-end=3D"2842" class=3D"">2.2 <strong data-start=
=3D"2818" data-end=3D"2842">Le fichier <code data-start=3D"2831" data-end=
=3D"2840">artisan</code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"2843" data-end=3D"3112" class=3D"">Le fichier <code data-s=
tart=3D"2854" data-end=3D"2863">artisan</code> est un script en ligne de co=
mmande utilis=C3=A9 pour interagir avec votre application Laravel. Il vous =
permet d'ex=C3=A9cuter des commandes comme <code data-start=3D"3000" data-e=
nd=3D"3019">php artisan serve</code> pour d=C3=A9marrer le serveur de d=C3=
=A9veloppement, ou <code data-start=3D"3066" data-end=3D"3090">php artisan =
make:model</code> pour cr=C3=A9er un mod=C3=A8le.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3114" data-end=3D"3150" class=3D"">2.3 <strong data-start=
=3D"3123" data-end=3D"3150">Le dossier <code data-start=3D"3136" data-end=
=3D"3148">bootstrap/</code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3151" data-end=3D"3246" class=3D"">Le r=C3=A9pertoire <cod=
e data-start=3D"3165" data-end=3D"3177">bootstrap/</code> contient des fich=
iers qui pr=C3=A9parent votre application =C3=A0 l'ex=C3=A9cution.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3248" data-end=3D"3529">
<li data-start=3D"3248" data-end=3D"3388" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3250" data-end=3D"3388" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
250" data-end=3D"3263"><code data-start=3D"3252" data-end=3D"3261">app.php<=
/code></strong> : Ce fichier initialise l'application Laravel. Il charge l'=
environnement, les services et la configuration de l'application.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3389" data-end=3D"3529" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3391" data-end=3D"3529" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
391" data-end=3D"3403"><code data-start=3D"3393" data-end=3D"3401">cache/</=
code></strong> : Contient les fichiers de cache n=C3=A9cessaires pour am=C3=
=A9liorer les performances, comme les caches de configuration et de routes.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"3531" data-end=3D"3564" class=3D"">2.4 <strong data-start=
=3D"3540" data-end=3D"3564">Le dossier <code data-start=3D"3553" data-end=
=3D"3562">config/</code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3565" data-end=3D"3688" class=3D"">Le r=C3=A9pertoire <cod=
e data-start=3D"3579" data-end=3D"3588">config/</code> contient tous les fi=
chiers de configuration de votre application. Par exemple, des fichiers com=
me :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3689" data-end=3D"3988">
<li data-start=3D"3689" data-end=3D"3825" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3691" data-end=3D"3825" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
691" data-end=3D"3704"><code data-start=3D"3693" data-end=3D"3702">app.php<=
/code></strong> : D=C3=A9finit les configurations principales de l'applicat=
ion, comme le nom, l'environnement, et le fournisseur de services.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3826" data-end=3D"3929" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3828" data-end=3D"3929" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
828" data-end=3D"3846"><code data-start=3D"3830" data-end=3D"3844">database=
.php</code></strong> : Contient les configurations de la base de donn=C3=A9=
es (connexion, migrations, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3930" data-end=3D"3988" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3932" data-end=3D"3988" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
932" data-end=3D"3946"><code data-start=3D"3934" data-end=3D"3944">mail.php=
</code></strong> : Param=C3=A8tres relatifs =C3=A0 l'envoi d'emails.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"3990" data-end=3D"4025" class=3D"">2.5 <strong data-start=
=3D"3999" data-end=3D"4025">Le dossier <code data-start=3D"4012" data-end=
=3D"4023">database/</code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"4026" data-end=3D"4119" class=3D"">Le r=C3=A9pertoire <cod=
e data-start=3D"4040" data-end=3D"4051">database/</code> contient tout ce q=
ui est li=C3=A9 =C3=A0 la base de donn=C3=A9es de l=E2=80=99application.</p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"4121" data-end=3D"4642">
<li data-start=3D"4121" data-end=3D"4244" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4123" data-end=3D"4244" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
123" data-end=3D"4139"><code data-start=3D"4125" data-end=3D"4137">factorie=
s/</code></strong> : Ce dossier contient des classes qui g=C3=A9n=C3=A8rent=
 des donn=C3=A9es de test ou de fausses donn=C3=A9es pour les tests.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4245" data-end=3D"4412" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4247" data-end=3D"4412" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
247" data-end=3D"4264"><code data-start=3D"4249" data-end=3D"4262">migratio=
ns/</code></strong> : Ce r=C3=A9pertoire contient les fichiers de migration=
, qui sont utilis=C3=A9s pour d=C3=A9finir la structure de la base de donn=
=C3=A9es et effectuer des changements.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4413" data-end=3D"4642" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4415" data-end=3D"4642" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
415" data-end=3D"4427"><code data-start=3D"4417" data-end=3D"4425">seeds/</=
code></strong> : Ce dossier contient les fichiers qui g=C3=A9n=C3=A8rent de=
s donn=C3=A9es par d=C3=A9faut dans la base de donn=C3=A9es. Les donn=C3=A9=
es g=C3=A9n=C3=A9r=C3=A9es peuvent =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=A9es pour remplir la=
 base de donn=C3=A9es avec des valeurs de test ou de production.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"4644" data-end=3D"4675" class=3D"">2.6 <strong data-start=
=3D"4653" data-end=3D"4675">Le dossier <code data-start=3D"4666" data-end=
=3D"4673">lang/</code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"4676" data-end=3D"4961" class=3D"">Le r=C3=A9pertoire <cod=
e data-start=3D"4690" data-end=3D"4697">lang/</code> contient tous les fich=
iers de langue pour votre application. Laravel prend en charge la traductio=
n et la localisation, et tous les fichiers de langue sont organis=C3=A9s ic=
i. Par exemple, <code data-start=3D"4881" data-end=3D"4898">fr/messages.php=
</code> contient les traductions pour les messages dans l'application.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4963" data-end=3D"4996" class=3D"">2.7 <strong data-start=
=3D"4972" data-end=3D"4996">Le dossier <code data-start=3D"4985" data-end=
=3D"4994">public/</code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"4997" data-end=3D"5086" class=3D"">Le r=C3=A9pertoire <cod=
e data-start=3D"5011" data-end=3D"5020">public/</code> est le point d'entr=
=C3=A9e de votre application. Ce dossier contient :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5087" data-end=3D"5411">
<li data-start=3D"5087" data-end=3D"5227" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5089" data-end=3D"5227" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
089" data-end=3D"5104"><code data-start=3D"5091" data-end=3D"5102">index.ph=
p</code></strong> : Le point d'entr=C3=A9e de toutes les requ=C3=AAtes HTTP=
. Ce fichier charge l'application Laravel et commence =C3=A0 traiter la req=
u=C3=AAte.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5228" data-end=3D"5336" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5230" data-end=3D"5336" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
230" data-end=3D"5249"><code data-start=3D"5232" data-end=3D"5238">css/</co=
de> et <code data-start=3D"5242" data-end=3D"5247">js/</code></strong> : Co=
