<p data-start=3D"417" data-end=3D"783" class=3D"">Dans ce tutoriel, nous al=
lons explorer en d=C3=A9tail le syst=C3=A8me de routage de Laravel, de la c=
r=C3=A9ation des routes simples aux concepts plus avanc=C3=A9s tels que les=
 <strong data-start=3D"573" data-end=3D"597">param=C3=A8tres de routes</str=
ong>, les <strong data-start=3D"603" data-end=3D"617">middleware</strong>, =
