<li data-start=3D"1226" data-end=3D"1371" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1228" data-end=3D"1371" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
228" data-end=3D"1244">Route::get()</strong> : Le premier param=C3=A8tre sp=
=C3=A9cifie la m=C3=A9thode HTTP (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, etc.). Ici, <code=
 data-start=3D"1330" data-end=3D"1337">get()</code> est utilis=C3=A9 pour u=
ne requ=C3=AAte GET.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1372" data-end=3D"1434" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1374" data-end=3D"1434" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
374" data-end=3D"1386">'/hello'</strong> : Le chemin de l'URL qui d=C3=A9cl=
enche cette route.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1435" data-end=3D"1585" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1437" data-end=3D"1585" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
437" data-end=3D"1457">Fonction anonyme</strong> : C'est l'action qui est e=
x=C3=A9cut=C3=A9e lorsque la route est visit=C3=A9e. Dans cet exemple, la f=
onction retourne un simple message texte.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1587" data-end=3D"1677" class=3D"">Vous pouvez tester cett=
e route en visitant <code data-start=3D"1630" data-end=3D"1654">http://loca=
lhost/hello</code> dans votre navigateur.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1679" data-end=3D"1719" class=3D"">1.2 <strong data-start=
=3D"1687" data-end=3D"1719">Les M=C3=A9thodes HTTP Support=C3=A9es</strong>=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1721" data-end=3D"1793" class=3D"">Laravel permet de g=C3=
=A9rer diff=C3=A9rentes m=C3=A9thodes HTTP =C3=A0 travers les routes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1795" data-end=3D"2156">
<li data-start=3D"1795" data-end=3D"1843" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1797" data-end=3D"1843" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
797" data-end=3D"1804">GET</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9e pour r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9re=
r des donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1844" data-end=3D"1929" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1846" data-end=3D"1929" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
846" data-end=3D"1854">POST</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9e pour envoyer des donn=
=C3=A9es (soumettre des formulaires, API POST).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1930" data-end=3D"2002" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1932" data-end=3D"2002" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
932" data-end=3D"1945">PUT/PATCH</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9e pour mettre =C3=
=A0 jour des ressources existantes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2003" data-end=3D"2057" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2005" data-end=3D"2057" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
005" data-end=3D"2015">DELETE</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9e pour supprimer des r=
essources.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2058" data-end=3D"2156" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2060" data-end=3D"2156" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
060" data-end=3D"2071">OPTIONS</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9e pour obtenir les op=
tions disponibles pour une ressource (moins utilis=C3=A9e).</p>
</li>
</ul>
