</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start=3D"2779" data-end=3D"2897" class=3D"">Cette commande g=C3=A9n=
=C3=A8re un contr=C3=B4leur avec des m=C3=A9thodes pour g=C3=A9rer les acti=
ons classiques associ=C3=A9es =C3=A0 un mod=C3=A8le <code data-start=3D"288=
9" data-end=3D"2895">Post</code> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2899" data-end=3D"3284">
<li data-start=3D"2899" data-end=3D"2952" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2901" data-end=3D"2952" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"290=
1" data-end=3D"2910">index()</code> : R=C3=A9cup=C3=A8re et affiche une lis=
te de posts.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2953" data-end=3D"3017" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2955" data-end=3D"3017" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"295=
5" data-end=3D"2965">create()</code> : Affiche le formulaire pour cr=C3=A9e=
r un nouveau post.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3018" data-end=3D"3083" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3020" data-end=3D"3083" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"302=
0" data-end=3D"3029">store()</code> : Enregistre un nouveau post dans la ba=
se de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3084" data-end=3D"3124" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3086" data-end=3D"3124" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"308=
6" data-end=3D"3094">show()</code> : Affiche un post sp=C3=A9cifique.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3125" data-end=3D"3182" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3127" data-end=3D"3182" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"312=
7" data-end=3D"3135">edit()</code> : Affiche le formulaire pour modifier un=
 post.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3183" data-end=3D"3250" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3185" data-end=3D"3250" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"318=
5" data-end=3D"3195">update()</code> : Met =C3=A0 jour un post existant dan=
s la base de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3251" data-end=3D"3284" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3253" data-end=3D"3284" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"325=
3" data-end=3D"3264">destroy()</code> : Supprime un post.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3286" data-end=3D"3381" class=3D"">Cela vous permet d=E2=
=80=99avoir des m=C3=A9thodes pr=C3=A9d=C3=A9finies pour un comportement de=
 contr=C3=B4leur classique.</p>
