<h3 data-start=3D"6412" data-end=3D"6447" class=3D"">5.2 Middleware et Cons=
tructeurs</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6449" data-end=3D"6774">
<li data-start=3D"6449" data-end=3D"6625" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6451" data-end=3D"6625" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
451" data-end=3D"6482"><code data-start=3D"6453" data-end=3D"6480">$this-&g=
t;middleware('auth')</code></strong> : Cela applique le middleware <code da=
ta-start=3D"6513" data-end=3D"6519">auth</code> =C3=A0 toutes les m=C3=A9th=
odes du contr=C3=B4leur, garantissant que l'utilisateur doit =C3=AAtre auth=
entifi=C3=A9 pour y acc=C3=A9der.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6626" data-end=3D"6774" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6628" data-end=3D"6774" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
628" data-end=3D"6689"><code data-start=3D"6630" data-end=3D"6687">$this-&g=
t;middleware('is_admin')-&gt;only(['create', 'edit'])</code></strong> : Cel=
a applique le middleware <code data-start=3D"6720" data-end=3D"6730">is_adm=
in</code> uniquement aux m=C3=A9thodes <code data-start=3D"6755" data-end=
=3D"6763">create</code> et <code data-start=3D"6767" data-end=3D"6773">edit=
</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6776" data-end=3D"6779" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6781" data-end=3D"6830" class=3D"">Partie 6 : <strong dat=
