<p data-start=3D"5866" data-end=3D"5941" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"586=
6" data-end=3D"5878">GET /posts</code> =E2=86=92 <code data-start=3D"5881" =
data-end=3D"5903">PostController@index</code> : Affiche la liste de tous le=
s posts.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5942" data-end=3D"6036" class=3D"">
