<h3 data-start=3D"2755" data-end=3D"2785" class=3D"">2.3 La Directive <code=
 data-start=3D"2776" data-end=3D"2785">@unless</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2787" data-end=3D"2933" class=3D"">La directive <code data=
-start=3D"2800" data-end=3D"2809">@unless</code> est un raccourci pour <cod=
e data-start=3D"2832" data-end=3D"2850">@if (!condition)</code>. Elle perme=
