<h4 data-start=3D"4201" data-end=3D"4245" class=3D"">Explications des r=C3=
=A8gles de validation :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4246" data-end=3D"4747">
<li data-start=3D"4246" data-end=3D"4286" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4248" data-end=3D"4286" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"424=
8" data-end=3D"4258">required</code> : le champ est obligatoire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4287" data-end=3D"4344" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4289" data-end=3D"4344" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"428=
9" data-end=3D"4297">string</code> : le champ doit =C3=AAtre une cha=C3=AEn=
e de caract=C3=A8res.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4345" data-end=3D"4411" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4347" data-end=3D"4411" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"434=
7" data-end=3D"4356">max:255</code> : la longueur maximale du champ est de =
255 caract=C3=A8res.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4412" data-end=3D"4472" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4414" data-end=3D"4472" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"441=
4" data-end=3D"4421">email</code> : le champ doit contenir une adresse emai=
l valide.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4473" data-end=3D"4554" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4475" data-end=3D"4554" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"447=
5" data-end=3D"4495">unique:users,email</code> : le champ <code data-start=
=3D"4507" data-end=3D"4514">email</code> doit =C3=AAtre unique dans la tabl=
e <code data-start=3D"4546" data-end=3D"4553">users</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4555" data-end=3D"4681" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4557" data-end=3D"4681" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"455=
7" data-end=3D"4568">confirmed</code> : v=C3=A9rifie que le champ de confir=
mation (ici <code data-start=3D"4613" data-end=3D"4636">password_confirmati=
on</code>) correspond au champ principal (<code data-start=3D"4669" data-en=
d=3D"4679">password</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4682" data-end=3D"4747" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4684" data-end=3D"4747" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"468=
4" data-end=3D"4691">min:8</code> : le mot de passe doit comporter au moins=
 8 caract=C3=A8res.</p>
</li>
</ul>
