<h3 data-start=3D"2973" data-end=3D"3018" class=3D"">2.2. Explication des r=
=C3=A8gles de validation</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3020" data-end=3D"3494">
<li data-start=3D"3020" data-end=3D"3078" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3022" data-end=3D"3078" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
022" data-end=3D"3036"><code data-start=3D"3024" data-end=3D"3034">required=
</code></strong> : Le champ doit =C3=AAtre pr=C3=A9sent et non vide.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3079" data-end=3D"3140" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3081" data-end=3D"3140" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
081" data-end=3D"3093"><code data-start=3D"3083" data-end=3D"3091">string</=
code></strong> : Le champ doit =C3=AAtre une cha=C3=AEne de caract=C3=A8res=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3141" data-end=3D"3201" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3143" data-end=3D"3201" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
143" data-end=3D"3154"><code data-start=3D"3145" data-end=3D"3152">email</c=
ode></strong> : Le champ doit =C3=AAtre une adresse email valide.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3202" data-end=3D"3311" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3204" data-end=3D"3311" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
204" data-end=3D"3228"><code data-start=3D"3206" data-end=3D"3226">unique:u=
sers,email</code></strong> : Le champ <code data-start=3D"3240" data-end=3D=
"3247">email</code> doit =C3=AAtre unique dans la table <code data-start=3D=
"3279" data-end=3D"3286">users</code> pour la colonne <code data-start=3D"3=
303" data-end=3D"3310">email</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3312" data-end=3D"3374" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3314" data-end=3D"3374" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
314" data-end=3D"3325"><code data-start=3D"3316" data-end=3D"3323">min:8</c=
ode></strong> : Le champ doit comporter au moins 8 caract=C3=A8res.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3375" data-end=3D"3494" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3377" data-end=3D"3494" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
377" data-end=3D"3392"><code data-start=3D"3379" data-end=3D"3390">confirme=
d</code></strong> : La confirmation du mot de passe doit correspondre au ch=
amp <code data-start=3D"3454" data-end=3D"3477">password_confirmation</code=
> dans la requ=C3=AAte.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3496" data-end=3D"3499" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3501" data-end=3D"3557" class=3D"">Partie 3 : <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3515" data-end=3D"3557">Personnalisation des Messages d'Erreur</=
