on <code data-start=3D"6172" data-end=3D"6189">CustomException</code> est l=
anc=C3=A9e.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6203" data-end=3D"6206" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6208" data-end=3D"6268" class=3D"">Partie 4 : <strong dat=
a-start=3D"6222" data-end=3D"6268">Les Codes de Statut HTTP et les Exceptio=
ns</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6270" data-end=3D"6312" class=3D"">4.1. Exceptions li=C3=
=A9es aux erreurs HTTP</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6314" data-end=3D"6449" class=3D"">Laravel utilise des exc=
eptions sp=C3=A9cifiques pour renvoyer des r=C3=A9ponses HTTP. Voici quelqu=
es-unes des exceptions li=C3=A9es aux erreurs HTTP :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6451" data-end=3D"6695">
<li data-start=3D"6451" data-end=3D"6513" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6453" data-end=3D"6513" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
453" data-end=3D"6480"><code data-start=3D"6455" data-end=3D"6478">NotFound=
HttpException</code></strong> : Utilis=C3=A9e pour les erreurs 404.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6514" data-end=3D"6595" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6516" data-end=3D"6595" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
516" data-end=3D"6547"><code data-start=3D"6518" data-end=3D"6545">Unauthor=
izedHttpException</code></strong> : Utilis=C3=A9e pour les erreurs 401 (non=
 autoris=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6596" data-end=3D"6695" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6598" data-end=3D"6695" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
598" data-end=3D"6633"><code data-start=3D"6600" data-end=3D"6631">MethodNo=
tAllowedHttpException</code></strong> : Utilis=C3=A9e pour les erreurs 405 =
(m=C3=A9thode HTTP non autoris=C3=A9e).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6697" data-end=3D"6785" class=3D"">Lorsque l'une de ces ex=
ceptions est lanc=C3=A9e, Laravel renvoie une r=C3=A9ponse HTTP appropri=C3=
=A9e.</p>
