<h3 data-start=3D"4711" data-end=3D"4745" class=3D"">2.2. Enregistrer un Mi=
ddleware</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4747" data-end=3D"4914" class=3D"">Pour que Laravel sache =
que ce middleware existe et comment l=E2=80=99utiliser, il doit =C3=AAtre e=
nregistr=C3=A9. Les middlewares sont enregistr=C3=A9s dans le fichier <code=
 data-start=3D"4892" data-end=3D"4913">app/Http/Kernel.php</code>.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4916" data-end=3D"4929" class=3D"">=C3=89tapes :</h4>
<ol data-start=3D"4931" data-end=3D"5339">
<li data-start=3D"4931" data-end=3D"4963" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4934" data-end=3D"4963" class=3D"">Ouvrez <code data-start=
=3D"4941" data-end=3D"4962">app/Http/Kernel.php</code>.</p>
</li>
