<h2 data-start=3D"88" data-end=3D"103" class=3D"">Introduction</h2>
<p data-start=3D"105" data-end=3D"521" class=3D"">L'authentification est un=
 aspect fondamental de toute application web s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e. Laravel o=
