<hr data-start=3D"4054" data-end=3D"4057" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4059" data-end=3D"4109" class=3D"">Partie 3 : <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4073" data-end=3D"4109">Gestion du Stockage des Fichiers</strong=
></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4111" data-end=3D"4232" class=3D"">Laravel fournit plusieu=
rs options pour stocker les fichiers t=C3=A9l=C3=A9charg=C3=A9s : <strong d=
ata-start=3D"4185" data-end=3D"4194">local</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"=
4196" data-end=3D"4206">public</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"4208" data-e=
nd=3D"4214">S3</strong> et bien d'autres.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4234" data-end=3D"4257" class=3D"">3.1. Stockage Local</h=
3>
<p data-start=3D"4259" data-end=3D"4399" class=3D"">Le stockage local enreg=
