<ul data-start=3D"8031" data-end=3D"8460">
<li data-start=3D"8031" data-end=3D"8174" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8033" data-end=3D"8174" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
033" data-end=3D"8057">Valider les fichiers</strong> : Assurez-vous que les=
