 class=3D"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light"><h1 da=
ta-start=3D"0" data-end=3D"76" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2" data-end=
=3D"74">Tests d'Int=C3=A9gration avec Laravel : Guide Complet (D=C3=A9butan=
t =C3=A0 Expert)</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"78" data-end=3D"429" class=3D"">Les tests d=E2=80=99int=C3=
=A9gration sont une partie essentielle du d=C3=A9veloppement d=E2=80=99une =
application Laravel robuste. Contrairement aux tests unitaires, qui v=C3=A9=
rifient <strong data-start=3D"231" data-end=3D"265">une seule unit=C3=A9 de=
 code isol=C3=A9e</strong>, les tests d=E2=80=99int=C3=A9gration s=E2=80=99=
assurent que <strong data-start=3D"306" data-end=3D"375">diff=C3=A9rents co=
mposants de l=E2=80=99application fonctionnent bien ensemble</strong> (base=
 de donn=C3=A9es, requ=C3=AAtes HTTP, middleware, etc.).</p>
<p data-start=3D"431" data-end=3D"540" class=3D"">Laravel facilite l=E2=80=
=99=C3=A9criture et l=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cution des tests d=E2=80=99int=C3=A9g=
ration gr=C3=A2ce =C3=A0 <strong data-start=3D"506" data-end=3D"537">PHPUni=
t et Laravel TestCase</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"542" data-end=3D"664" class=3D"">Dans ce tutoriel, nous al=
lons explorer en d=C3=A9tail les <strong data-start=3D"595" data-end=3D"618=
">tests d'int=C3=A9gration</strong> dans Laravel, des bases aux concepts av=
anc=C3=A9s.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"666" data-end=3D"669" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"671" data-end=3D"717" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"67=
4" data-end=3D"717">1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce qu=E2=80=99un test d=E2=80=99int=
=C3=A9gration ?</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"718" data-end=3D"983" class=3D"">Un test d=E2=80=99int=C3=
=A9gration vise =C3=A0 :<br data-start=3D"748" data-end=3D"751">
=E2=9C=85 V=C3=A9rifier qu=E2=80=99un ensemble de composants fonctionnent b=
ien ensemble.<br data-start=3D"818" data-end=3D"821">
=E2=9C=85 Tester les <strong data-start=3D"834" data-end=3D"887">routes, mi=
ddlewares, contr=C3=B4leurs, base de donn=C3=A9es</strong> et autres servic=
es.<br data-start=3D"907" data-end=3D"910">
=E2=9C=85 D=C3=A9tecter les erreurs qui n=E2=80=99apparaissent pas dans les=
 tests unitaires.</p>
<p data-start=3D"985" data-end=3D"997" class=3D"">Exemples :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"998" data-end=3D"1198">
<li data-start=3D"998" data-end=3D"1065" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1000" data-end=3D"1065" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifier qu=E2=80=
=99un utilisateur peut <strong data-start=3D"1032" data-end=3D"1062">s=E2=
=80=99inscrire et se connecter</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1066" data-end=3D"1126" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1068" data-end=3D"1126" class=3D"">Tester si une <strong d=
ata-start=3D"1082" data-end=3D"1123">API REST retourne les bonnes r=C3=A9po=
nses</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1127" data-end=3D"1198" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1129" data-end=3D"1198" class=3D"">Confirmer qu=E2=80=99un=
 <strong data-start=3D"1145" data-end=3D"1195">formulaire sauvegarde bien l=
es donn=C3=A9es en base</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1200" data-end=3D"1203" class=3D"">
