<hr data-start=3D"1254" data-end=3D"1257" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1259" data-end=3D"1311" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1262" data-end=3D"1309">2. Pourquoi utiliser le Service Container ?</strong=
></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1313" data-end=3D"1678" class=3D"">Le Service Container si=
mplifie la gestion des d=C3=A9pendances en offrant :<br data-start=3D"1383"=
 data-end=3D"1386">
=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"1388" data-end=3D"1413">Injection automatiq=
ue</strong> des d=C3=A9pendances dans les classes et contr=C3=B4leurs.<br d=
ata-start=3D"1462" data-end=3D"1465">
=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"1467" data-end=3D"1482">Flexibilit=C3=A9</s=
trong> en permettant de changer l=E2=80=99impl=C3=A9mentation d=E2=80=99une=
 d=C3=A9pendance facilement.<br data-start=3D"1553" data-end=3D"1556">
=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"1558" data-end=3D"1580">Testabilit=C3=A9 ac=
crue</strong> gr=C3=A2ce =C3=A0 la possibilit=C3=A9 de mocker les d=C3=A9pe=
ndances.<br data-start=3D"1630" data-end=3D"1633">
=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"1635" data-end=3D"1656">Code plus lisible</=
strong> et mieux structur=C3=A9.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1680" data-end=3D"1683" class=3D"">
