<h2 data-start=3D"1741" data-end=3D"1792" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1744" data-end=3D"1792">2. Configuration de Laravel pour le cryptage</stron=
g></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1794" data-end=3D"1926" class=3D"">Laravel int=C3=A8gre un=
