1496" data-end=3D"1531">2.1 R=C3=A9pertoire <code data-start=3D"1513" data-=
end=3D"1529">resources/lang</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1532" data-end=3D"1768" class=3D"">Dans un projet Laravel,=
 le r=C3=A9pertoire <code data-start=3D"1570" data-end=3D"1586">resources/l=
ang</code> contient des sous-r=C3=A9pertoires pour chaque langue support=C3=
