rs, etc. Cependant, cr=C3=A9er une API n'est pas suffisant, il est =C3=A9ga=
lement crucial de garantir sa <strong data-start=3D"1045" data-end=3D"1057"=
>s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1060" data-end=3D"1092" class=3D"">Pourquoi s=C3=A9curise=
r une API ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1094" data-end=3D"1152" class=3D"">Les API sont expos=C3=
=A9es =C3=A0 de nombreuses menaces, notamment :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1153" data-end=3D"1574">
<li data-start=3D"1153" data-end=3D"1254" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1155" data-end=3D"1254" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
155" data-end=3D"1177">Acc=C3=A8s non autoris=C3=A9</strong> : Toute person=
ne ou application non autoris=C3=A9e peut interagir avec votre API.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1255" data-end=3D"1441" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1257" data-end=3D"1441" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
257" data-end=3D"1296">Injections de donn=C3=A9es malveillantes</strong> : =
Les utilisateurs peuvent essayer d'injecter des donn=C3=A9es nuisibles pour=
 manipuler votre base de donn=C3=A9es ou ex=C3=A9cuter des actions non auto=
ris=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1442" data-end=3D"1574" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1444" data-end=3D"1574" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
444" data-end=3D"1480">Exposition des donn=C3=A9es sensibles</strong> : Si =
l'API n'est pas s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e, les donn=C3=A9es sensibles peuvent =C3=
=AAtre expos=C3=A9es =C3=A0 des attaquants.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1576" data-end=3D"1668" class=3D"">Dans ce tutoriel, nous =
allons mettre en place plusieurs techniques pour s=C3=A9curiser notre API.<=
/p>
<hr data-start=3D"1670" data-end=3D"1673" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1675" data-end=3D"1690" class=3D"">2. Pr=C3=A9requis</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1692" data-end=3D"1766" class=3D"">Avant de commencer, ass=
urez-vous d'avoir les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments suivants install=C3=A9s :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1768" data-end=3D"1950">
<li data-start=3D"1768" data-end=3D"1805" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1770" data-end=3D"1805" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
770" data-end=3D"1777">PHP</strong> (version 7.4 ou sup=C3=A9rieure)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1806" data-end=3D"1820" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1808" data-end=3D"1820" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
808" data-end=3D"1820">Composer</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1821" data-end=3D"1843" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1823" data-end=3D"1843" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
823" data-end=3D"1834">Laravel</strong> install=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1844" data-end=3D"1896" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1846" data-end=3D"1896" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
846" data-end=3D"1865">Base de donn=C3=A9es</strong> (par exemple, MySQL ou=
 SQLite)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1897" data-end=3D"1950" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1899" data-end=3D"1950" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
899" data-end=3D"1910">Postman</strong> ou tout autre outil pour tester les=
 API</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1952" data-end=3D"1955" class=3D"">
